#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:219
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:222
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, create the "
"directory used for the <filename class=\"extension\">.pid</filename> file "
"created when the <application>stunnel</application> daemon starts:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, crie "
"o diretório usado para o arquivo <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.pid</filename> criado quando o processo de segundo "
"plano <application>stunnel</application> inicia:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:228
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m750 -o stunnel -g stunnel -d /var/lib/stunnel/run &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown stunnel:stunnel /var/lib/stunnel</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m750 -o stunnel -g stunnel -d /var/lib/stunnel/run &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown stunnel:stunnel /var/lib/stunnel</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:232
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Next, create a basic <filename>/etc/stunnel/stunnel.conf</filename> "
"configuration file using the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Em seguida, crie um arquivo básico de configuração "
"<filename>/etc/stunnel/stunnel.conf</filename> usando os seguintes comandos "
"como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:237
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/stunnel/stunnel.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>; File: /etc/stunnel/stunnel.conf\n"
"\n"
"; Note: The pid and output locations are relative to the chroot location.\n"
"\n"
"pid    = /run/stunnel.pid\n"
"chroot = /var/lib/stunnel\n"
"client = no\n"
"setuid = stunnel\n"
"setgid = stunnel\n"
"cert   = /etc/stunnel/stunnel.pem\n"
"\n"
";debug = 7\n"
";output = stunnel.log\n"
"\n"
";[https]\n"
";accept  = 443\n"
";connect = 80\n"
";; \"TIMEOUTclose = 0\" is a workaround for a design flaw in Microsoft SSL\n"
";; Microsoft implementations do not use SSL close-notify alert and thus\n"
";; they are vulnerable to truncation attacks\n"
";TIMEOUTclose = 0</literal>\n"
"\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/stunnel/stunnel.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>; File: /etc/stunnel/stunnel.conf\n"
"\n"
"; Observação: os locais da saída gerada e do PID são relativos ao local do chroot.\n"
"\n"
"pid = /run/stunnel.pid\n"
"chroot = /var/lib/stunnel\n"
"client = no\n"
"setuid = stunnel\n"
"setgid = stunnel\n"
"cert = /etc/stunnel/stunnel.pem\n"
"\n"
";debug = 7\n"
";output = stunnel.log\n"
"\n"
";[https]\n"
";accept = 443\n"
";connect = 80\n"
";; \"TIMEOUTclose = 0\" é um contorno para uma falha de projeto no Microsoft SSL\n"
";; Implementações Microsoft não usam alerta de notificação de fechamento SSL e, portanto,\n"
";; elas são vulneráveis a ataques de truncamento\n"
";TIMEOUTclose = 0</literal>\n"
"\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:263
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Finally, add the service(s) you wish to encrypt to the configuration file. "
"The format is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Finalmente, adicione o(s) serviço(s) que deseja encriptar ao arquivo de "
"configuração. O formato é como segue:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:267
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>[<replaceable>&lt;service&gt;</replaceable>]\n"
"accept  = <replaceable>&lt;hostname:portnumber&gt;</replaceable>\n"
"connect = <replaceable>&lt;hostname:portnumber&gt;</replaceable></literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>[<replaceable>&lt;service&gt;</replaceable>]\n"
"accept = <replaceable>&lt;nome_dispositivo:número_porta&gt;</replaceable>\n"
"connect = <replaceable>&lt;nome_dispositivo:número_porta&gt;</replaceable></literal>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For a full explanation of the commands and syntax used in the configuration "
"file, issue <command>man stunnel</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para uma explicação completa dos comandos e da sintaxe usados no arquivo de "
"configuração, emita <command>man stunnel</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:290
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Boot Script</phrase> <phrase "
"revision=\"systemd\">Systemd Unit</phrase>"
msgstr ""
"<phrase revision=\"sysv\">Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de "
"Inicialização</phrase> <phrase revision=\"systemd\">Unidade do "
"systemd</phrase>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:294
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start the <command>stunnel</command> daemon when the system"
" is booted, install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/stunnel</filename> "
"bootscript from the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar automaticamente o processo de segundo plano "
"<command>stunnel</command> quando o sistema for inicializado, instale o "
"script de inicialização <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/stunnel</filename> a "
"partir do pacote <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To start the <command>stunnel</command> daemon at boot, enable the "
"previously installed <application>systemd</application> unit by running the "
"following command as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Para iniciar o processo de segundo plano <command>stunnel</command> na "
"inicialização, habilite a unidade do <application>systemd</application> "
"instalada anteriormente executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:311
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-stunnel</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-stunnel</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/stunnel.xml:313
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>systemctl enable stunnel</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>systemctl enable stunnel</userinput>"

